CHEAP HINTS#4

ANYONE CAN USE THE MAGIC ITEMS IN THE MAGIC SHOP. UNLESS OF COURSE
IT IS THE ARMOR AND WEAPONS IN WHICH CASE YOU ARE LIMITED BY THE
CLASS YOU CHOSE. ANY DAMAGE DONE BY SCROLLS AND WANDS AND MAGICAL
WEAPONS WILL ALWAYS BE BASED UPON YOUR ABILITIES. THEREFORE, IF
YOU ARE ONLY 1ST LEVEL DO NOT EXPECT A WAND OF LIGHTNING TO DEVASTATE
YOUR OPPONENTS.

WANDS ALL HAVE 10 CHARGES WHEN NEW BUT YOU CAN HAVE AN UNLIMITED
AMOUNT OF ANY WAND THAT YOU WANT. HOWEVER, YOUR BACKPACK WILL ONLY
HOLD 10 DIFFERENT KINDS OF ITEMS. FILLING YOUR BACKPACK WITH A
GOOD VARIETY OF SCROLLS AND WANDS IS A GOOD HABIT TO GET INTO.

YOU MAY WEAR ONLY TWO RINGS. ONE ON EACH HAND. IF BOTH HANDS HAVE
RINGS ON THEM AND YOU BUY A NEW ONE THEN THE ONE ON THE LEFT HAND
WILL BE REPLACED BY THE NEW ONE. THUS IT IS BEST TO SELL ANY RING
YOU DO NOT WANT BEFORE BUYING A NEW ONE.